  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/effectinsights/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/effectinsights/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 36px;\"><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Discord&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://x.com/Fusseel\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Twitter&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=x&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"116\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@heyitsfuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=YouTube&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"118\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=GitHub&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"108\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=CurseForge&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"143\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Fuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Modrinth&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"129\" height=\"28\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/effectinsights/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/about.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Effect Insights</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 為藥水與食物狀態效果加入簡潔說明，讓你隨時清楚了解每個效果的作用。物品上的效果會直接在提示資訊中顯示說明；玩家身上的活躍效果呢？只需在背包中將游標懸停在上方即可查看其作用。整體排版整齊一致，格式清晰易讀。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">也在尋找附魔說明嗎？歡迎嘗試同樣精彩的 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enchantment-insights\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Enchantment Insights</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 模組！</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/effectinsights/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/features.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">✨ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">效果說明：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 每種藥水與食物的效果都附有簡潔易懂的說明文字。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">👁️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">懸停查看詳情：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 在背包中將游標懸停在效果圖示上，即可立即查看詳細資訊。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">📝 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">額外資訊：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 可選顯示效果的來源模組與效果 ID，提供更多背景資訊。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🎨 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">美觀提示框：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 簡潔的版面與樣式設計，讓說明文字能自然融入提示框中。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⚙️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">彈性設定：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 可自行選擇說明的顯示時機與位置，並自由自訂排版格式。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/effectinsights/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/media.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/effectinsights/media/1.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/effectinsights/media/2.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/effectinsights/media/3.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/effectinsights/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/installation.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需於客戶端安裝</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/puzzles-lib\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Puzzles Lib</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（支援 Fabric 與 NeoForge）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/fabric-api\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Fabric API</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（僅限 Fabric）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/forge-config-api-port\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Forge Config API Port</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（僅限 Fabric）</span></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/effectinsights/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/configuration.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">若模組支援內建設定，可直接透過模組選單進行調整（在 Fabric 環境下需安裝由 Prospector 開發的 </span><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/modmenu\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Mod Menu</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">）。請注意，在較舊版的 Minecraft 中，還需安裝 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/config-menus-forge\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Forge Config Screens</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">若欲使用外部文字編輯器進行手動設定，所有檔案皆位於 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">.minecraft/config</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 資料夾內，檔名會依設定類型命名為 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-client.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">、</span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-common.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 或 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-server.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">。並非所有類型的設定檔都會存在於模組中。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/effectinsights/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/credits.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">感謝 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/azmalent\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">azmalent</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 與其舊作 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/potion-descriptions\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Potion Descriptions</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 模組，為本專案帶來主要靈感。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">特別感謝 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/DarkhaxDev\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Darkhax</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 及其 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enchantment-descriptions\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Enchantment Descriptions</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 模組，啟發了本專案的部分設計，尤其是在設定選項方面。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/effectinsights/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/armor-statues\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/armorstatues/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/diagonal-walls\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/diagonalwalls/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/ender-zoology\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enderzoology/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/effectinsights/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/studio.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/effectinsights/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>",
